  "answer": [
    {
      "label": "(a) 拉普拉斯变换积分性质的证明",
      "steps": [
        "设 $g(t)=\\int_0^t f(\\tau)d\\tau$，则 $g'(t)=f(t)$",
        "由拉普拉斯变换的导数性质（假设 $g(0)=0$）：",
        "$$\\mathcal{L}(g'(t))=\\mathcal{L}(f(t))=F(s)$$",
        "另一方面，由导数性质：",
        "$$\\mathcal{L}(g'(t))=s\\mathcal{L}(g(t))-g(0)=s G(s)-0=sG(s)$$",
        "其中 $G(s)=\\mathcal{L}(g(t))=\\mathcal{L}\\left(\\int_0^t f(\\tau)d\\tau\\right)$",
        "因此 $F(s)=sG(s)$",
        "解得：$$G(s)=\\mathcal{L}\\left(\\int_0^t f(\\tau)d\\tau\\right)=\\frac{F(s)}{s}$$",
        "这证明了拉普拉斯变换的积分性质。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "label": "(b) 利用拉普拉斯变换求解微分方程",
      "steps": [
        "对微分方程两边施加拉普拉斯变换（记 $\\mathcal{L}(y(x))=Y(s)$）：",
        "$$\\mathcal{L}\\left(\\frac{dy}{dx}\\right)+3\\mathcal{L}(y)+2\\mathcal{L}\\left(\\int_0^x y(s)ds\\right)=0$$",
        "应用拉普拉斯变换的导数性质和初值条件 $y(0)=1$：",
        "$$sY(s)-y(0)+3Y(s)+2\\cdot\\frac{Y(s)}{s}=0$$",
        "$$sY(s)-1+3Y(s)+\\frac{2Y(s)}{s}=0$$",
        "通分：$$Y(s)\\left(s+3+\\frac{2}{s}\\right)=1$$",
        "$$Y(s)\\cdot\\frac{s^2+3s+2}{s}=1$$",
        "$$Y(s)=\\frac{s}{s^2+3s+2}$$",
        "分解分母：$s^2+3s+2=(s+1)(s+2)$",
        "进行部分分式分解：",
        "$$Y(s)=\\frac{s}{(s+1)(s+2)}=\\frac{A}{s+1}+\\frac{B}{s+2}$$",
        "展开：$s=A(s+2)+B(s+1)$",
        "取 $s=-1$：$-1=A\\cdot 1 \\Rightarrow A=-1$",
        "取 $s=-2$：$-2=B\\cdot(-1) \\Rightarrow B=2$",
        "因此：$$Y(s)=\\frac{-1}{s+1}+\\frac{2}{s+2}$$",
        "反拉普拉斯变换：$$y(x)=\\mathcal{L}^{-1}\\left(\\frac{-1}{s+1}\\right)+\\mathcal{L}^{-1}\\left(\\frac{2}{s+2}\\right)$$",
        "$$y(x)=-e^{-x}+2e^{-2x}$$",
        "验证初值条件：$y(0)=-1+2=1$ ✓"
      ]
    }
  ],
